1
00:00:52,799 --> 00:00:54,479
Playing foreigners at their own game—brilliant!

2
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,679
In my 20-plus years in business,

3
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,799
I never expected to hear from a young man today

4
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:03,079
a master strategy capable of upending

5
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:04,359
the business landscape for the next decade.

6
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,319
And you are...?

7
00:01:08,599 --> 00:01:10,079
Me? My last name is Xu.

8
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:11,760
Ran a few small businesses back in the day.

9
00:01:12,159 --> 00:01:14,200
Young man, what you just said

10
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:16,040
was truly an eye-opener for me.

11
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:17,319
You're too kind, Brother Xu.

12
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,920
It's just theoretical talk.

13
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:21,879
Well, my young friend, let me ask you.

14
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:24,280
Earlier, you said traditional business models

15
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:25,640
are a complete red ocean.

16
00:01:26,519 --> 00:01:27,079
As far as I know,

17
00:01:27,079 --> 00:01:28,799
Nancheng's biggest player, Yunding Group,

18
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:31,000
is aggressively building commercial complexes.

19
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,760
In your opinion,

20
00:01:32,879 --> 00:01:33,599
are they wrong?

21
00:01:34,239 --> 00:01:35,760
Yunding's move is the right one,

22
00:01:36,879 --> 00:01:38,079
but they're moving too slowly.

23
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,040
Slowly?

24
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,799
If I were running Yunding,

25
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,519
I'd break Yunding up.

26
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:46,040
Aside from the current retail sales,

27
00:01:46,439 --> 00:01:48,239
I'd go all-in on supply chain finance

28
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:50,680
plus mega appliance experience complexes.

29
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,319
Shift from the fixed-rent mall model

30
00:01:54,599 --> 00:01:57,120
to a risk-sharing,

31
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,120
commission-based model with brands.

32
00:01:58,239 --> 00:01:59,079
Within three years,

33
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:00,719
Yunding's market cap would increase tenfold.

34
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,959
Too bad Chairman Shen

35
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,680
lacks that kind of vision.

36
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,919
In my past life, I saw an appliance titan

37
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,879
build a hundred-billion-dollar empire.

38
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:14,080
If I don't seize this trend,

39
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:16,719
wouldn't my rebirth be a total waste?

40
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,719
His ideas have already surpassed

41
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:22,840
the experience I gained abroad.

42
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,719
How did he manage that?

43
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,759
Young man,

44
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:28,919
you've truly opened my eyes today.

45
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,520
I haven't asked yet—

46
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,360
what's your name?

47
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,080
Sister-in-law!

48
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:41,800
Steel Structure!

49
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,560
Right!

50
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:43,680
Guangyue Steel Structure!

51
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,560
Yeah!

52
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,560
And Yi'an Tech and Haihong!

53
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:49,199
Don't sell, don't sell!

54
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,280
We definitely can't sell now!

55
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:52,840
Selling now would be penny-wise and pound-foolish!

56
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,719
All right, all right, all right.

57
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:56,479
Stop jumping at every twitch on the screen.

58
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:58,319
You can't just stare at stocks all day.

59
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,479
Go focus on something else first.

60
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:01,120
Is he an employee at your factory?

61
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,159
From our factory?

62
00:03:02,479 --> 00:03:03,400
What's his name?

63
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,080
Ma Dawei.

64
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,080
Ma Dawei?

65
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:08,639
He's actually our factory's

66
00:03:09,039 --> 00:03:10,159
major shareholder.

67
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,159
Our entire factory

68
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,240
depends on him.

69
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:13,520
If it weren't

70
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,680
for him,

71
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,560
all the workers in our plant

72
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,759
would've lost our jobs long ago.

73
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,039
Chairman Shen,

74
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:23,360
Chairman Xu is waiting in the boardroom.

75
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:32,680
Second Uncle,

76
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,840
Why didn't you say you were coming back?

77
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,280
I could've sent a car for you.

78
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,520
Chairman Shen, you have so much on your plate.

79
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:42,080
No need to trouble yourself over trifles.

80
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,280
Second Uncle...

81
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,639
I've run Yunding alone all these years,

82
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,680
walking on thin ice.

83
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,439
Though I've managed to keep things afloat,

84
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,960
I'm still far from your level back then.

85
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:54,479
If I've done anything wrong,

86
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:55,560
please feel free to correct me anytime.

87
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,360
Jialing,

88
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,439
your business tactics the past two years...

89
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,960
I've always approved of them.

90
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:00,800
These past two years,

91
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:03,000
Yunding has thrived under your management.

92
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,520
However,

93
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:07,439
business is just like personal conduct.

94
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,080
No matter how impressive your numbers look,

95
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:14,080
once your reputation is ruined,

96
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:17,480
the entire empire can crumble in an instant.

97
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,560
Jialing,

98
00:04:20,439 --> 00:04:22,319
you're the head of Yunding,

99
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,439
and at the same time,

100
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,160
a daughter-in-law of our Xu family.

101
00:04:28,439 --> 00:04:29,639
I hope you understand that

102
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,720
some boundaries must be respected.

103
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,839
You must never cross them.

104
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,360
You'd better watch yourself.

105
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:47,240
Chairman Xu.

106
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:48,839
Second Master.

107
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:51,160
How are the three stocks I asked about?

108
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:52,959
Our traders looked into them

109
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:55,199
and ran a professional analysis.

110
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:56,879
And?

111
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,600
Second Master, it's incredible!

112
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:01,519
All three stocks hit their limit up,

113
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,160
hitting the limit up eight days in a row!

114
00:05:03,759 --> 00:05:05,240
Guessing one right is one thing,

115
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:07,120
but he predicted every single one!

116
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,519
That young man you met,

117
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,800
who on earth is he?

118
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,720
To predict all of them with such precision...

119
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:14,480
I originally thought

120
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,879
he just had a unique strategic vision,

121
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,040
I didn't expect a financial genius too.

122
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,800
A man like him is bound for greatness.

123
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,959
If Yunding could recruit him,

124
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,360
we'd forge another century of glory!

125
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,480
I must pay him a personal visit

126
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:30,959
and befriend this young man.

127
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,199
A true master hides in plain sight.

128
00:05:38,759 --> 00:05:40,160
In the stock market and business,

129
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:42,279
a genius with such formidable power

130
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,279
actually lives in such a humble area.

131
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:46,480
He's truly extraordinary.

132
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:51,519
Excuse me, is anyone home?

133
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:53,839
Hello, sir, who are you looking for?

134
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:55,839
Excuse me, ma'am.

135
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,120
I'm looking for someone.

136
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:59,040
A guy working at Jinhua Garment Factory,

137
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,040
named Ma Dawei.

138
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,240
Does he live here?

139
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,639
You're looking for my brother-in-law!

140
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:05,000
Are you here to talk business with him?

141
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,560
I really asked the right person!

142
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,439
We hit it off so well last time.

143
00:06:08,839 --> 00:06:10,240
So I came specifically to visit him.

144
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,120
Is he home right now?

145
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:11,879
He went to the factory.

146
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:12,759
He'll be back soon.

147
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:13,879
Come inside and take a seat.

148
00:06:15,319 --> 00:06:16,639
What bad timing.

149
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,639
Maybe I should come back next time.

150
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,959
Sir, you haven't eaten yet, have you?

151
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,600
I just made a few home-cooked dishes.

152
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,800
If you don't mind,

153
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,759
have a bite with us first.

154
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:31,040
Well...

155
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,519
Don't mind if I do, then.

156
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,839
Come on in, make yourself at home.

157
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,480
I brought a little something.

158
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:36,879
Here.

159
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:37,199
Oh, you...

160
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,800
You're too kind! You shouldn't have.

161
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,720
Let me take that for you.

162
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,360
All right, thank you.

163
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,000
Watch your step.

164
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:46,079
Take your time.

165
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,759
Right this way.

166
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:54,360
Xiaohui, who is it?

167
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,279
Dad,

168
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,560
he's looking for...

169
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,759
You... you...

170
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,160
You!

171
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,360
Aren't you that...

172
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:06,439
from Heixiazigou Platoon...

173
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,160
Third Platoon...

174
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:09,720
Platoon Leader...

175
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,439
Xu Datou!

176
00:07:11,439 --> 00:07:12,759
Big Monkey!

177
00:07:13,279 --> 00:07:14,160
Brother Monkey!

178
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,199
How is it you?

179
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,600
Back in 1972...

180
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,600
the two of us...

181
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:24,160
We were sent down to the countryside in the Great Northern Wilderness!

182
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,600
We're old pals!

183
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:27,759
We even shared the same bunk bed back then!

184
00:07:28,399 --> 00:07:29,680
I never dreamed in a million years...

185
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,399
that right here...

186
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,839
I'd run into you!

187
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,360
I know, right!

188
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,439
We must have a good drink today!

189
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,399
Come, hurry, sit down!

190
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:36,240
A couple of drinks won't be enough!

191
00:07:36,319 --> 00:07:37,120
I'll go get the liquor!

192
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:39,120
So you and my dad are old comrades!

193
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,639
I'll whip up a few more dishes.

194
00:07:40,759 --> 00:07:42,079
Have a good drink with my dad today,

195
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:42,839
and catch up on old times.

196
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:43,920
Thank you so much for the trouble.

197
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,439
It's truly...

198
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,160
Heaven must have brought us together!

199
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:47,759
It really did!

200
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,759
It's been decades since we last met.

201
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,120
It's been over 20 years.

202
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:53,600
You haven't changed a bit all this time.

203
00:07:53,879 --> 00:07:55,160
You haven't changed either!

204
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:55,839
My brother!

205
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,240
Come on.

206
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:56,800
Bottoms up!

207
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,560
Bottoms up! Drink up!

208
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:07,600
This taste...

209
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:10,040
It's like what we had for New Year's

210
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,360
in the Great Northern Wilderness back then.

211
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,600
Brother Ma, let me tell you,

212
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:15,439
in all my years traveling far and wide,

213
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,000
this is the taste I've missed.

214
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,480
You're in luck today.

215
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:18,879
Yeah.

216
00:08:18,879 --> 00:08:20,040
It's all my daughter-in-law,

217
00:08:20,519 --> 00:08:21,399
Xiaohui's cooking.

218
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:23,360
Xiaohui isn't just a great cook,

219
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,360
she's a wonderful person too.

220
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:27,040
Ever since my eldest son passed away,

221
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,800
Xiaohui has been the one

222
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,120
taking care of everything inside and out.

223
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,240
Here, have some food.

224
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,000
Eat up, have some more.

225
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,600
Such a dutiful daughter-in-law, brother.

226
00:08:34,639 --> 00:08:36,120
I really envy you.

227
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,559
Yeah, truly.

228
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:39,320
How have you been these past few years?

229
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,960
Flying all over, busy with nothing.

230
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,080
I don't even have a home.

231
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,200
I really envy you, brother.

232
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,039
Bottoms up, bottoms up!

233
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:45,720
Come on, cheers.

234
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,519
You have a successful career now,

235
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:48,720
living such a full life!

236
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:49,679
Dad,

237
00:08:49,919 --> 00:08:51,279
the chicken stew with mushrooms is ready.

238
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:52,720
Take it easy on the drinking.

239
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,759
I'll go get some fruit.

240
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,480
Don't bother, sister, please don't.

241
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:55,960
It's no trouble.

242
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:58,840
I don't know if you still remember,

243
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,759
back when you were with the brigade,

244
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,159
you were quite the handsome lad.

245
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:05,840
Wearing that

246
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,960
faded green military uniform,

247
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,120
and driving...

248
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:09,919
driving a...

249
00:09:10,159 --> 00:09:11,480
Dongfanghong brand

250
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,639
tractor,

251
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,559
you pulled right into our factory.

252
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:15,360
And then...

253
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:17,440
all the young girls in our factory,

254
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,039
and the young wives too,

255
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,600
couldn't take their eyes off you.

256
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:25,440
Come on, brother,

257
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:26,679
don't just talk about me.

258
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:28,279
You weren't bad yourself!

259
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:29,360
I was nowhere near you.

260
00:09:29,759 --> 00:09:31,080
When you played that accordion...

261
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,240
The accordion, right, the accordion!

262
00:09:33,799 --> 00:09:34,279
And...

263
00:09:34,759 --> 00:09:36,799
the female sent-down youth at our station,

264
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:38,480
what was her name again?

265
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,159
Xiao Song, Xiao Song!

266
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,320
Xiao Song!

267
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:44,279
Yes, that's her!

268
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:44,919
Xiao Song!

269
00:09:45,759 --> 00:09:46,399
Xiao Song.

270
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,240
All day long,

271
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:50,279
she'd stand by the door to hear you play,

272
00:09:50,279 --> 00:09:51,159
and nothing could drive her away.

273
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,600
Come on, brother,

274
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:54,159
tell me the truth now.

275
00:09:54,159 --> 00:09:55,200
Back then, between you and her...

276
00:09:56,759 --> 00:09:57,080
You and her...

277
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,039
She and I had...

278
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,720
a pure, revolutionary comrade relationship!

279
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:01,879
Dad!

280
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,600
How much did you drink?

281
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:06,679
My son!

282
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:07,879
Dawei!

283
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:08,919
